# component-architecture

## Media Card System

The architecture implements a two-tiered card component system for handling media content:

### Base Media Card Component
- Implements dynamic rendering logic to switch between clickable (`<a>`) and non-clickable (`<span>`) containers based on `href` presence
- Located at: `src/components/card-media.astro`

### YouTube Extension Pattern
- Extends base media card specifically for YouTube video content
- Integrates specialized video embedding capabilities through `@astro-community/astro-embed-youtube`
- Handles metadata layout pattern with title and optional description fields 
- Located at: `src/components/card-youtube.astro`

